# Generated at deploy by build_live_eligibility_projection.py: which live claims still certify NOW.
# Absent, every live claim renders as Verified reports (fail closed).
auxsays/_data/live_eligibility.yml
# Generated at deploy by build_verdict_projection.py: lib/patch_decision.decide's WAIT / TEST FIRST
# per page, the only source the verdict gate publishes them from. Absent, no page shows one.
auxsays/_data/verdict_projection.yml
# Generated at deploy by build_monitoring_projection.py, never committed: the state is a function
# of the current time and of ingest state that every scheduled lane moves, so any committed copy
# went stale between push and CI. The layouts fail closed to 'unverified' when it is absent.
auxsays/_data/monitoring_state.yml
auxsays/_data/monitoring_company_state.yml
# Generated at deploy by source_health_snapshot.py (pages.yml), never committed. It is a function of
# ingest state that every scheduled lane moves, so the committed copy went stale (37 rows against 47
# sources, an older status vocabulary). No template, include or layout reads it; see AUX-069.
auxsays/_data/source_health.yml
auxsays/assets/img/patch-logos/_generation-report.json
auxsays/tools/local-browser-capture/launcher/*.exe
